#: ../../source/docs/common-leds-pixhawk.rst:5
#: 78bf727bc10f41d3a6777c303c8e89dd
msgid "LEDs Meaning"
msgstr "LED 含义"

#: ../../source/docs/common-leds-pixhawk.rst:7
#: 1c8b35a6200a49da95457911350bae04
msgid ""
"This topic explains how to interpret the colours and flash sequence of the "
"main and/or external LED(s), if the "
":ref:`NTF_LED_OVERRIDE<NTF_LED_OVERRIDE>` parameter is set to its "
"``standard`` default setting. Some of the LED patterns have associated "
"sound/tone patterns as listed in :ref:`Sounds (Pixhawk) <common-sounds-"
"pixhawkpx4>`."
msgstr ""
"本主题说明如何解读主 LED 和/或外部 LED 的颜色和闪烁序列，前提是 "
":ref:`NTF_LED_OVERRIDE<NTF_LED_OVERRIDE>` 参数设置为 ``standard`` 默认值。部分 LED "
"模式有对应的声音/音调模式，如 :ref:`声音（Pixhawk）<common-sounds-pixhawkpx4>` 所列。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-leds-pixhawk.rst:12
#: 642083fbeab14afbb8d9f0316cb57d2f
msgid "Boards with 1 or 2 Notify LEDS"
msgstr "具有 1 或 2 个通知 LED 的飞控板"

#: ../../source/docs/common-leds-pixhawk.rst:14
#: 47086761411f4551aa144f6d12529d87
msgid ""
"These boards have one(LED A) or two(LED A and LED B) leds on the board, "
"normally, but not always, green and blue, respectively."
msgstr "这些飞控板通常有一个（LED A）或两个（LED A 和 LED B）板载 LED，通常（但不总是）分别为绿色和蓝色。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-leds-pixhawk.rst:16
#: 8824cc80724d4f34bec3c31e2ea9ea02
#, no-python-format
msgid ""
"After boot, LED A usually shows system status, while LED B shows GPS status."
" Each sequence of flashes shown below repeats every second. So, LED A will "
"flash with a 50% duty cycle at 4Hz , alternating with LED B, when the "
"autopilot is in ESC calibration mode."
msgstr ""
"启动后，LED A 通常显示系统状态，而 LED B 显示 GPS 状态。下面显示的每个闪烁序列每秒重复一次。因此，当飞控处于 ESC "
"校准模式时，LED A 将以 50% 占空比 4Hz 频率闪烁，与 LED B 交替。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-leds-pixhawk.rst:18
#: b238d8e4a3094be6968ea3648404b171
msgid ""
"The states and events are shown in order of precedence. For example, LED A "
"will flash the battery failsafe sequence even if RC is in failsafe also, in "
"the two LED case."
msgstr "状态和事件按优先级顺序显示。例如，在双 LED 情况下，即使 RC 也处于失控保护状态，LED A 也会闪烁电池失控保护序列。"

